  "description": "The MG Renegade is designed to haul a** over any terrain. It’s the most lightweight Micro Hauler™ at only 44 lbs, yet still packs in tons of power with a 749W cargo-geared motor in a lightweight full-sized bmx-inspired bike frame (for example, easily lift this bad boy into any bike rack). The MG Renegade is armed with 20 mph of 100% electric speed, an unlockable 24 mph Off-Road Mode, 48+ miles of range, a color display, 2-piston hydraulic brakes, a twist throttle, Highrise Handlebars, front and back lights, front and rear fenders, and a mullet wheel design with off-road tires.And with over 10 attach points and a 27.2 mm seat post, the Renegade is compatible with thousands of bike accessories so you can mod it how you like it for max utility. Tested & compliant with UL2271 and UL2272. Ships almost fully assembled with charger and assembly tools.",
